{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1Nlbm5hLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Senna","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/dmRfKme3j8mbTf4iTJd0L8wtaQa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pP9Or3dN8k0go1G2OSldcwBpUFO.jpg","description":"Fascinated by cars since childhood, Brazilian racer Ayrton Senna became a sports legend — until tragedy struck, changing Formula 1 forever.\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 6/6","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1Nlbm5hLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Calling","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Ayrton Senna begins his racing career in Formula Ford. Far from home and dreaming big, he craves recognition and more opportunities on the track.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hCeF3A4RPa5O3F0hIxs9PaAu8EV.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1Nlbm5hLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Belonging","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After catching Peter Warr's eye, Senna makes a decisive career move. A trip to Italy elevates his car's performance. Alain Prost and Senna cross paths.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/XojH7NRLvZEQVmmKDGVX7421XQ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1Nlbm5hLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"Ambition","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Galvão discusses Senna's duty to Brazil. A karaoke night opens doors. Ayrton's rivalry with Prost intensifies before the 1988 World Championship.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n8ntLGwDGEHjeq7hVA6kiiX2FjF.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1Nlbm5hLSUyODIwMjQtJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Passion","season":1,"episode":4,"r